                                "sense_id": "0a490217-fc4e-3845-87b2-712185430010",
                                "text": "The correction of barbaralalia (foreign accent) is in the strictest sense speech re-education, since the speech correctionist is aiding the foreign speaker to change one set of speech habits for another."
